# c1
> (openai + claude).best
@forward c2
@text <700

Compare three apartments in Valencia for a household with EUR 80,000 available upfront and a maximum total housing payment of EUR 2,200 per month.
Estimate a fair purchase-price range, flag legal and building risks, and list facts that require professional verification.

# c2
> openai.reasoning
@forward c3
@text <900

Using %from c1, estimate conservative, base, and optimistic resale values after 5 and 10 years.
Include purchase taxes, selling costs, renovation, maintenance, and inflation assumptions.

# c3
> auto
@file -markdown apartment_decision.md

Use %from c1 and %from c2 to write a practical buy / renegotiate / reject recommendation.
Keep assumptions separate from facts that require verification.
